  - key: Hub.drone_flight.Title
    fontId: 2
    chinese: "\u65E0\u4EBA\u673A\u98DE\u884C"
    english: Drone Flight
  - key: Hub.drone_flight.Subtitle
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u8D77\u98DE\u3001\u7A7F\u8D8A\u4E0E\u7CBE\u51C6\u64CD\u63A7"
    english: Take off, explore and master flight
  - key: Hub.drone_flight.Description
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u5728\u8BAD\u7EC3\u573A\u63A2\u7D22\u98DE\u884C\u624B\u611F\u3002\n\u9009\u62E9\u673A\u578B\uFF0C\u5F00\u59CB\u4F60\u7684\u98DE\u884C\u4F53\u9A8C\u3002"
    english: 'Explore flight in the training ground.

      Choose a drone and start
      flying.'
  - key: Hub.dlss.Title
    fontId: 2
    chinese: "DLSS \u5B9E\u9A8C\u5BA4"
    english: DLSS Laboratory
  - key: Hub.dlss.Subtitle
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u63A2\u7D22\u753B\u8D28\u4E0E\u6027\u80FD\u7684\u5E73\u8861"
    english: Explore image quality and performance
  - key: Hub.dlss.Description
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u5207\u6362\u753B\u8D28\u6A21\u5F0F\uFF0C\u6BD4\u8F83\u753B\u9762\u4E0E\u6027\u80FD\u3002\n\u4F53\u9A8C\u5B9E\u65F6\u6E32\u67D3\u6280\u672F\u5E26\u6765\u7684\u5DEE\u5F02\u3002"
    english: 'Switch quality modes and compare the image.

      Explore real-time
      rendering technology.'
  - key: Hub.ui_validation.Title
    fontId: 2
    chinese: "UI \u4EA4\u4E92\u5C55\u53F0"
    english: UI Showcase
  - key: Hub.ui_validation.Subtitle
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u65B0\u7684\u4F53\u9A8C\uFF0C\u5373\u5C06\u5F00\u653E"
    english: A new experience is coming
  - key: Hub.ui_validation.Description
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u754C\u9762\u4E0E\u5BFC\u822A\u7684\u4EA4\u4E92\u4F53\u9A8C\u3002\n\u5C55\u53F0\u6B63\u5728\u51C6\u5907\u4E2D\uFF0C\u656C\u8BF7\u671F\u5F85\u3002"
    english: 'Explore interfaces and navigation.

      The showcase is being prepared.'
  - key: Hub.wall_squeeze.Title
    fontId: 2
    chinese: "\u5939\u7206\u5B83"
    english: Wall Squeeze
  - key: Hub.wall_squeeze.Subtitle
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u63A8\u5899\u5939\u51FB\uFF0C\u4FDD\u62A4\u4F4F\u6237"
    english: Crush monsters and protect residents
  - key: Hub.wall_squeeze.Description
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u62D6\u52A8\u6ED1\u5899\uFF0C\u628A\u7EA2\u602A\u8D76\u62E2\u5939\u7206\u3002\n\u79FB\u5F00\u84DD\u8272\u4F4F\u6237\uFF0C\u7559\u51FA\u5B89\u5168\u7A7A\u95F4\u3002"
    english: 'Drag the walls to crush red monsters.

      Move blue residents to
      safety.'
  - key: Hub.kagit_kart.Title
    fontId: 2
    chinese: "\u7EB8\u827A\u5361\u4E01\u8F66"
    english: Paper Kart
  - key: Hub.kagit_kart.Subtitle
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u7FFB\u5F00\u7EB8\u9875\uFF0C\u5F00\u59CB\u6BD4\u8D5B"
    english: Turn the page and start racing
  - key: Hub.kagit_kart.Description
    fontId: 0
    chinese: "\u9A7E\u9A76\u526A\u7EB8\u8D5B\u8F66\uFF0C\u7A7F\u8FC7\u7ACB\u4F53\u4E66\u8D5B\u9053\u3002\n\u4E2D\u6587\u5355\u4EBA\u79FB\u690D\u5F00\u53D1\u4E2D\u3002"
    english: 'Race paper karts through pop-up tracks.

      A Chinese single-player
      adaptation.'
